1
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:24,880
[RADIO] Multiple explosions across Old Market. Power is failing. The main clinic road is blocked.

2
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:33,144
[RADIO] Joint Response Command, respond. The district relay is down. The command channel is silent.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,112
[DALIA] Major Dalia Rahim, J R C field command. Convoy survivors located. Extraction is underway.

4
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,936
[SAMIRA] Engineer Samira Haddad, civil infrastructure. Families and road crews are trapped beyond the clinic route.

5
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:06,200
[ARIA] I am ARIA, the Civic Relay assistant. Relay integrity is partial. Command channels are offline.

6
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,760
[ARIA] Emergency continuity protocol active. One valid command authority remains.

7
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,904
[ARIA] Old Market is the immediate priority. Armed movement is closing on the blocked clinic route.

8
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,168
[ARIA] Commander identity confirmed. I will advise. Authority remains yours.

9
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,352
[ARIA] This was coordinated. Power, roads, and command failed in sequence.

10
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,592
[DALIA] Two J R C squads are still responding. The nearest forward post is dark.

11
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,704
[SAMIRA] Civilians, clinic staff, and municipal crews remain behind the closure.

12
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,136
[ARIA] The pattern suggests coordination. Attribution is not yet reliable.

13
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,888
[COMMANDER] Connect the response. Protect the clinic corridor. Confirm targets before engagement.

14
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,688
[DALIA] Confirmed armed Ash Line patrol approaching Old Market. No heavy weapons observed.

15
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:36,560
[ARIA] Three armed hostiles confirmed. Civilians remain behind the barriers. Keep fire inside the marked corridor.

16
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,776
[DALIA] Field units are ready. Tactical control is yours, Commander.

17
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,592
[ARIA] Select the rifle squad. Move to cover. Secure the corridor.
